{"title":"XAND Gate","slug":"XAND_Gate","pageid":1873,"revid":9571,"timestamp":"2024-02-09T15:36:22Z","lastEditor":"Er0rd0tExe","categories":["Stubs","Logic","Logic_Gates"],"infobox":{"type":"Logic","fields":[{"label":"title","value":"{{PAGENAME}}"},{"label":"Island","value":"Finlay"},{"label":"Store","value":"Alan's AutoLogistics"},{"label":"Cost","value":"$340"},{"label":"Requires","value":"Wire (2 Input signals)"},{"label":"Date Added","value":"01/11/2023"},{"label":"Version Added","value":"v1.43.0"},{"label":"Status","value":"Obtainable"}]},"sections":[{"id":"functionality","text":"Functionality"}],"body":"<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ok-tablewrap\"><table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><p><span>This page is a <span data-unresolved=\"1\">stub</span>!</span><br>\n<span>You can help the Oaklands Wiki by <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://oaklands.fandom.com/wiki/XAND_Gate?action=edit\">expanding it</a>.</span></p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table></div><blockquote><p><i>\"Similar to the AND gate, however, it will output 10.0 when both inputs are equal to 0.0\"</i></p></blockquote>\n\n<p>The <b>XAND Gate</b> is a logic gate that can be purchased from <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Alan's_AutoLogistics/\">Alan's AutoLogistics</a>.\n</p>\n<h2 id=\"functionality\">Functionality</h2>\n<p>The XAND Gate is effectively an <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/AND_Gate/\">AND Gate</a> and a <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/NOT_Gate/\">NOT Gate</a> combined. When both inputs are the same, the XAND gate outputs a signal of 0. Otherwise, it outputs a signal of 10.\n</p>\n\n</div>"}
